  lines:
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 0
    text: "Yeah girl hold on a second, I\u2019ve gotta go reapply my lipstick and
      take a leak real quick. "
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 0
    text: "Alright. But I\u2019d advise you to go to the bathroom on the third floor. "
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 0
    text: "What? Why? That\u2019s so many stairs!"
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 0
    text: "Some girl vomited all over on the first floor toilets. And there\u2019s
      a weird smell in the hallway on the second floor, so I\u2019d avoid that one
      as well."
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 0
    text: "Tch. It\u2019s always something in this school. Can we not have one normal
      day where everything works as it should? "
    videoEventId: 
